  "details": "I have 10 trackers and 5 basestations (2 different spaces). This means that with the headset and controllers, I have 18 devices that load into VRChat, which breaks at least two trackers unless I very carefully load in the trackers every time I open vrchat. Often when the devices repair they jump to the bottom of the list and get kicked off. Steam recently(ish) updated the limit from 16 to 64, but put the onus onto developers to allow that. Even just 24 devices allowed would be fantastic.",
